# CommonsSec_Age

## Overview

Redistributes the `age` file-encryption tool and its hardware-token plugins as a
dk package, providing the signing-key recovery tooling across Windows, Linux, and
macOS slots.

`CommonsSec_Age` bundles the official released binaries of
[age](https://github.com/FiloSottile/age),
[age-plugin-yubikey](https://github.com/str4d/age-plugin-yubikey) (PIV), and
[age-plugin-fido2-hmac](https://github.com/olastor/age-plugin-fido2-hmac)
(FIDO2/passkey) so the dkpkg signing flow
(`dksdk-coder/scripts/prepare-dkpkg-version.ps1`) has pinned, reproducible tooling
to encrypt signing transcripts to hardware recovery recipients. Binaries are
fetched from each project's official GitHub releases and verified by SHA-256.

